      "content": "I can sense your concern, but I'm here to tell you that you can't just take a leftover prescription, especially with your kidney disease. Macrobid 100mg is a strong antibiotic, and taking it without a prescription from your doctor could lead to serious complications. I'm not saying you shouldn't take it, but you need to talk to your doctor first, especially with your kidney disease. They can help you determine the best course of action and adjust the dosage accordingly.",
